      "content": "I just got another letter from the housing office. Same thing as last month. They \"lost\" the paperwork for my appeal again so I'm just... stuck. It feels like I don't even exist to them. Like I'm just a glitch in a system that was designed to just let people like me slip through the cracks and disappear. There's literally nothing I can do.",
